  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nNumbers = 25, 30, 50, 75\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 25 = 5 × 5\n\n⇒ 30 = 2 × 3 × 5\n\n⇒ 50 = 2 × 5 × 5\n\n⇒ 75 = 3 × 5 × 5\n\n⇒ LCM of 25, 30, 50 and 75 = 2 × 3 × 5 × 5 = 150\n\n**Therefore, the LCM of 25, 30, 50 and 75 is 150.**",
